                "loc": "REV.18.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ubuso 18:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu misumba ya muno calo ca Yuda na mu misebo ine iya mu Yerusalemu, ine nshakaleke mukaleumfwika nakabili utupundu twansansa, nangufye amashiwi ya bashibwinga naya banabwinga. Icalo cikasanguka amatololo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.7.34",
